# Scanora design core

Scanora is a calm health-tech product. Prefer clarity over decoration.

## Product constraints

- One focused flow: upload → understand → chat.
- No sidebars, dashboards, extra pages, or fake marketing stats.
- Do not look like a hospital admin tool or a flashy AI landing page.

## Principles

- Keep the main task obvious. Users should always know what they can do next.
- Use plain language. No jargon, no clever labels.
- Show status, results, and errors next to the work they belong to.
- Prevent mistakes when possible (reject unsupported files early).
- Prefer simple layouts: one column, clear hierarchy, generous but not empty spacing.
- Accessibility and readable contrast are not optional.

## Avoid

- Glassmorphism, heavy gradients, large shadows, giant heroes
- Extra cards nested in cards
- Unnecessary icons, animation, or navigation
- Storing medical report data in localStorage
